  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian mine action in Nagorno Karabakh. Clearance, survey, mine risk education and advocacy.Goal: Risks from mines, cluster munitions and other explosive weapons are reduced to a level where civilians can live safely and development is not constrained.</narrative>
